                    "message": "Added a test to check general API correctness"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1620,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "This assert would always be true\n\n```\nstruct pldm_msgbuf_ro {\n\tconst uint8_t *cursor;\n\tintmax_t remaining;\n};\n```\n\nctx->remaining is a intmax_t\n\nintmax_t has a range [INTMAX_MIN, INTMAX_MAX]\n\nhttps://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/intmax_t.3type.html\n\nso I think the assert is redundant."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1620,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "I expect it should be `SIZE_MAX` rather than `INTMAX_MAX` in the condition."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1620,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Konstantin Aladyshev",
                        "email": "aladyshev22@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Kostr"
                    },
                    "message": "Using SIZE_MAX gives:\n```\nerror: comparison of integer expressions of different signedness: 'intmax_t' {aka 'long int'} and 'long unsigned int' [-Werror=sign-compare]\n```\nFor now I've removed this check"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1620,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Konstantin Aladyshev",
                        "email": "aladyshev22@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Kostr"
                    },
                    "message": "Added check with a cast"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1620,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1650,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "Same comment as line 1710"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/msgbuf/core.h",
                    "line": 1650,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Konstantin Aladyshev",
