                    },
                    "message": "I think ideally here should be `pldm_msgbuf_field_begin`, but I don't know how to achieve this.\n\nThe file `tests\\msgbuf.hpp` includes only `msgbuf\\core.h`, but not the `msgbuf\\msgbuf.h`. Instead `msgbuf.hpp` has some other wrappers that replace code from the `msgbuf\\msgbuf.h`. And I don't understand how to add wrappers for the new `pldm_msgbuf_field_begin`, `pldm_msgbuf_field_end` functions. Since they transform \"field\" to \"&(field) \" they should be probably written as defines, but apparently I can't copy the code with Generic as-is.\n\nFor now I've used `pldm__msgbuf_ro_field_begin` from the `msgbuf\\core.h`"
                },
